    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1json_1_1_object_key" kindref="compound">ObjectKey</ref> is a used to capture keys in <ref refid="classllvm_1_1json_1_1_object" kindref="compound">Object</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Like <ref refid="classllvm_1_1json_1_1_value" kindref="compound">Value</ref> but:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>only strings are allowed</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>it&apos;s optimized for the string literal case (Owned == nullptr) Like <ref refid="classllvm_1_1json_1_1_value" kindref="compound">Value</ref>, strings must be UTF-8. See isUTF8 documentation for details. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
